WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:05.533
Two guys were talking.

2
00:00:05.534 --> 00:00:08.008
They looked mean and tough.

3
00:00:08.009 --> 00:00:12.369
"What should we do this weekend, Buster?" one guy asked.

4
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:15.638
Buster shrugged. "I don't know, Carl.

5
00:00:15.639 --> 00:00:17.761
Do you want to rob a bank?"

6
00:00:17.762 --> 00:00:23.450
"No way," Carl said. "Rocket Girl will catch us."

7
00:00:23.451 --> 00:00:25.031
Buster shook his head.

8
00:00:25.032 --> 00:00:27.227
"I don't like Rocket Girl.

9
00:00:27.228 --> 00:00:31.280
Bad guys like us can't do anything in Metro City.

10
00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:33.932
There must be a way to get rid of her."

11
00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:40.895
Carl nodded. "I wish we knew who she was . . ."

12
00:00:40.896 --> 00:00:43.183
"Ugh!" Mara said.

13
00:00:43.184 --> 00:00:47.142
"I still don't know how to do this math problem."

14
00:00:47.143 --> 00:00:50.240
Roxy and her friends were studying for a math test.

15
00:00:50.241 --> 00:00:54.999
"Let me see," Terrell said. "Maybe I can help you."

16
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.087
"This stuff is confusing," Roxy said.

17
00:00:58.088 --> 00:01:00.263
"How are you doing, Jack?"

18
00:01:00.264 --> 00:01:03.086
"Huh?" Jack looked up from his phone.

19
00:01:03.087 --> 00:01:04.994
Roxy rolled her eyes.

20
00:01:04.995 --> 00:01:08.383
"You're supposed to be studying, Jack!"

21
00:01:08.384 --> 00:01:13.888
Jack put down his phone. "I know, I know!"

22
00:01:13.889 --> 00:01:16.330
The friends worked quietly.

23
00:01:16.331 --> 00:01:19.880
Mara nodded as Terrell explained the math problem.

24
00:01:19.881 --> 00:01:22.445
"Thanks, Terrell," Mara said.

25
00:01:22.446 --> 00:01:25.791
"I'm not very good at math—yet!"

26
00:01:25.792 --> 00:01:28.044
"That's right," Terrell said.

27
00:01:28.045 --> 00:01:31.776
"You'll get better. It just takes practice."

28
00:01:31.777 --> 00:01:33.854
Jack picked up his phone again.

29
00:01:33.855 --> 00:01:37.229
Suddenly he started laughing.

30
00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:40.693
"What are you watching?" Roxy asked.

31
00:01:40.694 --> 00:01:42.342
Jack showed her his phone.

32
00:01:42.343 --> 00:01:44.860
"Terrell made a Clocktime video!"

33
00:01:44.861 --> 00:01:49.041
Roxy looked at the phone's cracked screen.

34
00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:54.922
She giggled. "Terrell! Is that the Rocket Girl Dance Challenge?"

35
00:01:54.923 --> 00:01:58.734
"Yeah!" Terrell said. "I made it yesterday.

36
00:01:58.735 --> 00:02:01.791
It took me two days to learn the dance."

37
00:02:01.792 --> 00:02:05.128
The friends watched the video. Terrell danced.

38
00:02:05.129 --> 00:02:09.794
At the end he yelled, "I'm Rocket Girl's Number One fan!"

39
00:02:09.795 --> 00:02:14.595
Roxy gave him a funny look. Terrell grinned.

40
00:02:14.596 --> 00:02:19.567
"I need to learn that dance." Mara got up and danced.

41
00:02:19.568 --> 00:02:23.509
"Maybe Rocket Girl will make a video too," Jack said.

42
00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:27.332
"She would never do that!" Roxy said.

43
00:02:27.333 --> 00:02:29.412
Mara and Jack looked confused.

44
00:02:29.413 --> 00:02:32.503
"How do you know that?" Jack asked.

45
00:02:32.504 --> 00:02:34.407
Roxy gulped.

46
00:02:34.408 --> 00:02:39.110
"Um, Jack, your phone is cracked," Terrell said quickly.

47
00:02:39.111 --> 00:02:42.781
Jack shrugged. "I know. I dropped it."

48
00:02:42.782 --> 00:02:46.291
"You should be more careful with it," Terrell said.

49
00:02:46.292 --> 00:02:48.531
"Whew!" Roxy thought.

50
00:02:48.532 --> 00:02:51.253
"Terrell always knows when to help me!"

51
00:02:51.254 --> 00:02:53.223
Just then she heard a beep.

52
00:02:53.224 --> 00:02:55.309
She thought it was her watch.

53
00:02:55.310 --> 00:02:58.111
But Terrell picked up his phone.

54
00:02:58.112 --> 00:03:03.071
"I got an email from school," he said. "Oh, wow!"

55
00:03:03.072 --> 00:03:05.586
"What is it?" Roxy asked.

56
00:03:05.587 --> 00:03:10.664
"The Metro City Good Student Society contacted our school," Terrell said.

57
00:03:10.665 --> 00:03:15.899
"They want to give me an award!"

